# Cargo Ship (2/3 flying, vigilance, crew 1): on turn 3 Bot1 taps Llanowar Elves (power 1, exactly enough for crew 1) to crew
# it, and it attacks as an artifact creature with Flying and Vigilance: 2 damage, and it is still untapped after attacking (CR
# 702.20b) while the Elves that crewed it are tapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Llanowar Elves
Cargo Ship
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Cargo Ship.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Cargo Ship.Activate(Ability: Crew)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Cargo Ship.Keywords = Flying; Vigilance
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Cargo Ship > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Cargo Ship.Tapped = false
? Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Tapped = true

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 18
